                            <comment id="14620017" author="sboikov" created="Thu, 9 Jul 2015 07:08:25 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Correction: TCK should work with default settings. So for distributed caches close(), if called on a server node, should not destroy cache, just set &apos;close&apos; state for current IgniteCache instance, after this on server node it should be possible to get another non closed isntance for this cache.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
